---
fmContentType: glossaryEntry
term: "Feminized Seeds"
letter: "F"
anchor: "feminized-seeds"
category: "growing"
---

Cannabis seeds bred to produce only female plants. Female plants produce the cannabinoid-rich flowers used for consumption; male plants produce pollen and, if left with females, cause seeding which reduces bud quality and potency. Feminized seeds eliminate the need to identify and remove male plants, simplifying home cultivation. The vast majority of seeds sold for home growing are feminized.
